    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is found, then take it if reachable, check it, move to destination, finally do specific task.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
