    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\tDO FindObject\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectInRange? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO CheckObject\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsDestinationReached? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO SpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
